    {
      "key": "te9ff0898bbb55898",
      "english": "A demo account lets you learn the platform and practice your rules without risking real capital. Demo results can still differ from live trading. Execution, liquidity and emotions all play a part.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "模擬帳戶讓您學習平台並練習交易規則，而無需承擔真實資金損失的風險。模擬結果仍可能與實盤交易不同，成交執行、流動性和情緒都會產生影響。"
    },
    {
      "key": "t050b58cf9dfe347d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Readers exploring </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">up forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> educational resources should prioritize clear explanations, credible information, and a realistic understanding of uncertainty. </span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">探索</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">up forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">教育資源的讀者，應優先選擇清楚的解釋、可信的資訊，以及對不確定性的務實理解。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta116da2cca98d8d8",
      "english": "A good forex strategy needs more than chart patterns or economic news. You need to recognize trends and ranges, understand the fundamentals, set clear rules and manage risk at every step.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "一個好的外匯策略需要的不僅僅是圖表模式或經濟新聞。您需要識別趨勢和範圍，瞭解基本原理，制定明確的規則並在每一步管理風險。"
    },
    {
      "key": "te3ef6237608964df",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. What are the key steps to building a forex trading strategy?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。制定外匯交易策略的關鍵步驟是什麼？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0af4ec0055e85066",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. Which technical indicators are useful for forex analysis?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3。哪些技術指標對外匯分析有用？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td247f4d2ef3b1be4",
      "english": "Learn how account equity differs from balance, how floating P/L changes it in real time, and how to read these figures clearly on MT5.",
      "kind": "text",
      "sources": [
