    },
    {
      "key": "t70f233926f0ecc26",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For traders exploring</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">forex trading in the UAE</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">, understanding Balance, Equity, and floating P/L provides an important foundation before moving into margin and leverage mechanics.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">對於探索</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">阿聯酋外匯交易</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">的交易者來說，了解餘額、淨值與浮動盈虧，是進一步學習保證金和槓桿機制的重要基礎。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb6acb6ba80437a58",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account balance is the settled value of a trading account excluding current open-position profit or loss. Account equity adjusts that balance in real time for floating P/L. Floating P/L is the unrealized result of open trades, which is why Balance and Equity can show different figures at the same moment.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">帳戶餘額是交易帳戶已結算的價值，不包括當前未平倉部位的損益。帳戶淨值是在餘額基礎上即時計入浮動盈虧後的數值。浮動盈虧是未平倉交易尚未實現的結果，因此餘額和淨值可能在同一時刻顯示不同的數字。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t34e41bbbc01e2fb5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Account Balance?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是賬戶餘額？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta543db502b9aa348",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account balance</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> is the settled value of a trading account before the current profit or loss on open positions is included.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">賬戶餘額</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">是指交易賬戶在包含當前持倉盈虧之前的結算價值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t03b769993d56b901",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Withdrawals</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">提款</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t67f67fda5165997a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Profit from closed trades</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平倉交易的利潤</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8d09d97bee69f739",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Losses from closed trades</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平倉交易造成的損失</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9a8d7dd579061aa7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Financing or swap adjustments already applied</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已應用融資或掉期調整</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb767e7d41eee22ac",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Balance is therefore useful for understanding settled account value, but it does not provide the complete real-time picture when positions remain open.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，餘額對於瞭解結算賬戶價值很有用，但它無法提供未平倉頭寸的完整實時情況。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7330da727b69b6d6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Account Equity?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是賬戶淨值？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9891396dc64d31d5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account equity</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> is the current value of a trading account after the net floating profit or loss from open positions is included.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">賬戶淨值</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">是指交易賬戶在計入未平倉淨浮動盈虧後的當前價值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tece23dd497c2fc0c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">In brokerage-account terminology, this is the practical definition of equity for a forex or CFD trading account: it combines the settled Balance with the current unrealized result of open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在經紀賬戶術語中，這是外匯或差價合約交易賬戶權益的實際定義：它將結算餘額與未平倉頭寸的當前未實現結果相結合。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2b64436cafafa594",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Equity = Balance + Net Floating P/L</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">淨值 = 餘額 + 淨浮動盈虧</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t77deac8fdf69ad31",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The net floating P/L may be positive or negative.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">淨浮動盈虧可能為正或為負。</span>"
    },
    {
