    },
    {
      "key": "tfc969644848d713c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Floating Profit and Loss?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是浮動盈虧？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1dd17a8ad33ba16c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Floating P/L</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> is the unrealized profit or loss associated with positions that are still open.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">浮動盈虧</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">是與未平倉頭寸相關的未實現利潤或損失。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6141cc3eeb5ff082",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">While the position remains open, the result is unrealized.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">當倉位保持未平倉狀態時，結果尚未實現。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t837a8c7d2404da29",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">When the trade closes:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易結束時：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc3307dfb041aeb79",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The closed position stops contributing floating P/L to Equity.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平倉頭寸停止為淨值貢獻浮動盈虧。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tedf19867c06ddabb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is why Balance can stay exactly the same for some time while Equity moves continuously.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這就是為什麼餘額可以在一段時間內保持完全相同，而淨值卻不斷變化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t51ead4c2b559c83e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is the Difference Between Account Balance and Account Equity?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">賬戶餘額和賬戶淨值有什麼區別？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbc4ca385bda5ecb9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account Balance shows settled account value, while Account Equity shows the account's current value after floating P/L is included.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">賬戶餘額顯示已結算的賬戶價值，而賬戶淨值顯示包含浮動盈虧後的賬戶當前價值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc2c95a6dd071da21",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What It Measures</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">衡量什麼</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4a96d7c3503674bd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stays Fixed When...</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在...時保持固定</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4d1139b404a76d6c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Settled account value</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已結算賬戶價值</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tea0369892db87861",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A position closes, a deposit or withdrawal posts, or another completed balance adjustment occurs</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">頭寸平倉、存款或取款過賬或其他已完成的餘額調整發生</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3c2c4bdc7e9d71ca",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Open positions simply move in price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">未平倉頭寸只是價格變動</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t98bb8eb33604ff39",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account Equity</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-drawdown-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-drawdown-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">賬戶淨值</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta02b0e5b7466133d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Current account value including open-position results</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">當前賬戶價值，包括未平倉頭寸結果</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6aeb0e382de1c110",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Floating P/L or Balance changes</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">浮動盈虧或餘額變化</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9a07a91c6ee22b7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Neither Balance nor floating P/L changes</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">餘額和浮動盈虧都沒有變化</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbbc80d826bdcdade",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Floating P/L</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">浮動盈虧</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c452f062f13e150",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Unrealized result of open positions</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">未平倉結果</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9186ddd4e8e7a39c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market prices change while positions remain open</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市場價格發生變化，而持倉仍保持不變</span>"
    }
  ]
}
